id: tail-proficiency
name: Tail Proficiency
talentCategory: racial
race: saiyan
prerequisites: Saiyan, Tailed chosen for the 5th effect of Saiyan Heritage
# Lost as Saiyan Heritage's Option becomes Tailless: its Progression row emptied, another Talent the player's (dbu-ttrpg.mjs).
tailedOnly: true
description: >
  With training, you are able to use your tail for combat purposes.
text: >
  Tail Proficiency: With training, you are able to use your tail for combat purposes.
  –Prerequisites: Saiyan, Tailed chosen for the 5th effect of Saiyan Heritage
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: While in the Oozaru Transformation, increase your Strike Rolls by 1(T).
  (3)-[1/Encounter]: You may use the Tail Attack Maneuver, but your Profile for that Attacking Maneuver is Simple.
  (4)-[Automatic]: If your effect for the Option effect of Saiyan Heritage becomes Tailless, lose this Talent and gain another Talent that you meet the Prerequisites for.

---

[passive]
# (1)
wound += 1(T);
# (2) Waits on Transformations - the Oozaru is not built yet.
# (3) The Tail Attack opened while the tail is had; through this alone, once an Encounter and the Simple Profile only - no
# variant asked (use-maneuver.mjs, maneuvers.mjs tailProficiencyOnly).
if (tailed) {
    allow tailProficiency.attack;
}
# (4) Its header's `tailedOnly`.
